  "prefLabel": "Rev 3103.02 Due Date of Return",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 3103.02 Due Date of Return. The taxpayer shall file the return on or before April 15 following the calendar year in which any gambling winnings are received.\n\nSource. #9689-B, eff 4-2-10",
